{'symbol': 'APD', 'date': '2021-03-15 10:00:00', 'title': 'AIR PRODUCTS PLACES ITS NEWEST AND SIXTH ASU ONSTREAM IN CHANDLER, ARIZONA', 'text': 'LEHIGH VALLEY, PA., MARCH 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0AIR PRODUCTS (NYSE: APD), A WORLD LEADING INDUSTRIAL GAS PRODUCER, TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS NEWEST AIR SEPARATION\xa0UNIT (ASU) IN CHANDLER, ARIZONA IS ONSTREAM AND UNDER LONG-TERM CONTRACT SUPPLYING KEY ELECTRONICS AND OTHER CUSTOMERS.'}